eba-id=\"221471\">この<ruby>芝<rp>(</rp><rt>しば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>刈<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らなければならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This grass needs cutting.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">渋い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しぶい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">涩；苦涩；涩口；粗涩；酸；朴素；淡雅；素雅；沉静；低调；有品味；愁眉苦脸；不悦；阴沉；闷闷不乐；吝啬；小气</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">私物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しぶつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">私人财产；个人物品；个人物件</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">しぶとい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">顽强；坚韧；持久；执着；倔强；固执；坚定不移</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"107800\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>結構<rp>(</rp><rt>けっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しぶといね。<ruby>転<rp>(</rp><rt>ころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでもただでは<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きぬ、いい<ruby>根性<rp>(</rp><rt>こんじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しているよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He&#x27;s a tenacious guy who always manages to come out on top. He&#x27;s the kind of guy who can turn any situation to his advantage.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lan